---
source: crates/pinewasm_mir/src/tests.rs
expression: "lower_source(\"indicator(\\\"W\\\")\\nvar i = 0\\ni := 0\\nwhile i < 10\\n    if i == 5\\n        break\\n    i := i + 1\\n    continue\\nplot(i)\\n\")"
---
